# Read-only upstream reference clones (mirror the ~/Desktop/openclaw pattern;
# see CLAUDE.md). Cloned locally for greppable reference, never committed.
# Root-anchored so it only ignores the top-level clone — vendored copies of
# Paperclip assets under apps/ (e.g. the baked `paperclip` skill) stay tracked.
/paperclip/

# Marketplace-agent source lives on the marketplace (S3 artifact + live EFS), not the repo.
/agents/

